    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi></math></p><p>where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi></math>&nbsp;is the cube root of unity. So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now, let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>21</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>21</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>21</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><